      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِتَّامَ</span></b> , (T, S,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِتِّيَامٌ</span>, (T, S, M,) <i>He</i> (a
man) <i>slaughtered his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِيمَة</span> [q. v.]: (T, S, M:)
and in like manner, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِتَّامَتْ</span>, said of a woman:
(T:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اتّيام</span> signifies the <i>slaughtering camels,</i>
and <i>sheep</i> or <i>goats, for no cause.</i> (IAar, T.)

